{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A place to [b]unwind, mix drinks, and serve warm meals[/b] to charming guests\u2014whether in fullscreen or tucked neatly at the bottom of your screen[/b] as you go about your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/GIF_0.gif?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/Title_Art_1_English.png?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your bar stocked, set the perfect table, and welcome your guests with care. After all, the heart of a great bar is the people inside it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/GIF_1.gif?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/Title_Art_2_English.png?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire staff to keep things running while you sit back and relax. No rush, no pressure\u2014just the soothing hum of a bar that flows on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And... of course, if the mood strikes, you can always jump in.               </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/GIF_2.gif?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/Title_Art_3_English.png?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Style your bar, set the mood, and make it the coziest spot by the lake. And don\u2019t forget the little yard above\u2014it\u2019s yours to decorate and shape however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/GIF_3.gif?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/Title_Art_4_English.png?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lakeside Bar isn\u2019t just about simple routines\u2014there\u2019s always something fun to do. Try your hand at fishing, test your aim at darts, and stay tuned for more surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/GIF_4.gif?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/Title_Art_5_English.png?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just enter your Twitch channel name, and Lakeside Bar will link your chatters' names to customers in the game, turning them into guests at your bar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A little touch of magic to bring you and your community closer together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/Twitch_English.png?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/Title_Art_6_English.png?t=1747159760\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new drinks, snacks, and music. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out fresh recipes to impress your guests. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your resources for a smoother flow. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And much more, all at your pace!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3527370?t=1747159760","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747159760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/135d00c0c8d81664c58b41a2f850564ecec8690f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747159760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/135d00c0c8d81664c58b41a2f850564ecec8690f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747159760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A place to [b]unwind, mix drinks, and serve warm meals[/b] to charming guests\u2014whether in fullscreen or tucked neatly at the bottom of your screen[/b] as you go about your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/GIF_0.gif?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/Title_Art_1_English.png?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep your bar stocked, set the perfect table, and welcome your guests with care. After all, the heart of a great bar is the people inside it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/GIF_1.gif?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/Title_Art_2_English.png?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire staff to keep things running while you sit back and relax. No rush, no pressure\u2014just the soothing hum of a bar that flows on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And... of course, if the mood strikes, you can always jump in.               </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/GIF_2.gif?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/Title_Art_3_English.png?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Style your bar, set the mood, and make it the coziest spot by the lake. And don\u2019t forget the little yard above\u2014it\u2019s yours to decorate and shape however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/GIF_3.gif?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/Title_Art_4_English.png?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lakeside Bar isn\u2019t just about simple routines\u2014there\u2019s always something fun to do. Try your hand at fishing, test your aim at darts, and stay tuned for more surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/GIF_4.gif?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/Title_Art_5_English.png?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just enter your Twitch channel name, and Lakeside Bar will link your chatters' names to customers in the game, turning them into guests at your bar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A little touch of magic to bring you and your community closer together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/Twitch_English.png?t=1747159760\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/extras/Title_Art_6_English.png?t=1747159760\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new drinks, snacks, and music. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try out fresh recipes to impress your guests. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your resources for a smoother flow. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And much more, all at your pace!</p></li></ul>","developers":["BITCOVER"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3417120","name":"Lakeside Bar"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3527370/b4e56a6decf6be207e0edc5b4cce9019d457f7a6/header.jpg?t=1747159760","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257137302,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137302/movie480.mp4?t=1747023906","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137302/movie_max.mp4?t=1747023906"},"name":"Trailer Schinese","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257137302/01b65fbb2def5522f4cc989debdf2d21caf29670/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747023906","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137302/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747023906","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137302/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747023906"}}],"name":"Lakeside Bar Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3 @ 3.2 GHZ<br></li><